      "description": "Share of ingested scores that are negative, neutral, or positive. The metric carries the sign bucket only, deliberately: one series per score value per evaluator is a cardinality problem, and the full distribution is on GET /api/scores, which the console charts. Use this panel to notice a shift; use the console to read it.",
